# VFS_STUDIO_TREE.todo
# Sprint Execution File — VFS Parent References & Studio Tree Hierarchy
# Agent: SWE 1.5 | Risk: Zero Regression on Frontend
# Objective: Invert the directory structure from `children` arrays to `parent` references to achieve O(1) adjacency scalability, and build a customized Sanity Structure Tree.

